# Non-secret azd environment binding for the CI/CD runners.
#
# This file mirrors the identifiers and endpoints of the existing local
# `rag-agent-dev` azd environment so GitHub Actions can reconstruct the same
# binding on an ephemeral runner. It must never contain credentials, tokens,
# keys, connection strings, or the azd resource-token salt.
